* uncertainty-aware exposure
* liquidity-aware sizing
* drawdown-sensitive behavior
### Goal
Elara should protect itself during uncertainty.
---
## 14. Runtime Cognitive Modes
### Add
* defensive mode
* opportunistic mode
* crisis mode
* recovery mode
### Why
Different environments require different reasoning biases.
---
# YEAR 1 — QUARTER 4
# MEMORY, SIMULATION, AND LIGHTWEIGHT MACHINE LEARNING
## Goal
Create adaptive learning capability.
NOT unrestricted self-modification.
---
