* confidence weighting
* semantic retrieval
* memory aging
---
## 16.Simulation Environment
### Add
* slippage simulation
* exchange outage simulation
* delayed fill simulation
* black swan replay
* liquidity collapse simulation
### Why
Systems that survive simulation survive production better.
---
## 17. Lightweight ML Integration
### DO NOT start with giant deep learning systems.
### Start with
* ensemble models
* boosting models
* probabilistic ML
### Libraries
* LightGBM
* XGBoost
* CatBoost
### Why
Financial data is noisy.
Simple models often outperform overcomplicated systems.
---
## 18. Portfolio Intelligence Layer
### Add
* correlation awareness
* exposure clustering
* portfolio regime detection
* dynamic allocation
### Why
Portfolio behavior matters more than isolated trades.
---
# END OF YEAR 1 TARGET
At the end of Year 1, Elara should become:
* stable
* observable
* replayable
* event-driven
* probabilistic
* regime-aware
* low-latency
* explainable
* scalable
NOT:
* AGI
* fully autonomous recursive AI
* self-evolving singularity machine
Those are excellent ways to create catastrophic complexity.
