# FINAL NOTE
The biggest danger for Elara is not lack of intelligence.
The biggest danger is uncontrolled complexity.
A smaller system that:
* survives
* adapts
* explains itself
* manages uncertainty
* preserves capital
is more valuable than a gigantic “AI super trader” that collapses under operational chaos.
Complexity should only grow when:
* observability grows
* governance grows
* reliability grows
* maintainability grows
Otherwise Elara becomes another ambitious engineering graveyard.
Humanity already has enough of those.
